---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "合作廠商"
permalink: /partners/
---
<h1>合作廠商</h1>
<p>以下為與本病房合作之廠商,如有需要可直接聯繫。</p>

{% if partners.list.length %}
<div class="vendor-grid">
  {% for partner in partners.list %}
  <div class="vendor-card">
    <div class="vendor-card__header">
      {% if partner.logo %}
      <img src="{{ partner.logo }}" alt="{{ partner.name }}標誌" class="vendor-card__logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      {% else %}
      <span class="vendor-card__icon material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">{{ partner.icon or "storefront" }}</span>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="vendor-card__heading">
        <p class="vendor-card__name">{{ partner.name }}</p>
        {% if partner.category %}<span class="m3-chip m3-chip--secondary">{{ partner.category }}</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    {% if partner.note %}<p class="vendor-card__note">{{ partner.note }}</p>{% endif %}

    {% if partner.address %}
    <p class="vendor-card__address">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">location_on</span>
      {{ partner.address }}
    </p>
    {% endif %}

    {% if partner.phone %}
    <a href="tel:{{ partner.phone }}" class="btn btn--tonal vendor-card__call">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">call</span>
      {{ partner.phone }}
    </a>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% else %}
<p>目前尚無合作廠商資料。</p>
{% endif %}
